---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import TimeLineElement from "../components/cv/TimeLine.astro";
---

<BaseLayout sideBarActiveItemID="cv">

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">About</div>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-10 text-lg leading-relaxed">
    <p>
      Machine learning researcher and engineer with expertise in <strong>Explainable AI, Computer Vision, and Generative AI</strong>. Passionate about building interpretable and scalable AI systems that combine theoretical rigor with practical impact. 4+ years designing, developing, and deploying production machine learning systems across vision, language, and multimodal domains. Proven track record bridging academic research and industry applications, with peer-reviewed publications in top-tier AI venues. Fluent in English (C2), French (B2), Spanish (Native), with working knowledge of German and Italian.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Education</div>
  </div>

  <div class="time-line-container grid gap-4 mb-10">
    <TimeLineElement
      title="King's College London, London, United Kingdom"
      subtitle="MSc in Advanced Computing (Computer Science)"
      date="Sep 2023 – Jan 2025"
    >
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5">
        <li>Graduated with <strong>Distinction</strong> (among the top students in the cohort).</li>
        <li><strong>Master’s Thesis:</strong> Real-Time Incremental Explanations and Saliency Maps for Object Detection in Videos (92/100), supervised by Prof. Hana Chockler.</li>
        <li><strong>Scholarship:</strong> Colfuturo - Foundation for the Future of Colombia (ranked 4th nationwide, top 0.5% of 779 shortlisted candidates).</li>
        <li><strong>Relevant Coursework:</strong> Neural Networks and Deep Learning (VAEs, GANs), Computer Vision, Data Mining, Multi-Agent Systems.</li>
        <li><strong>Extracurriculars:</strong> Research Assistant in Explainable AI; Student Lead, Google Developer Student Club (GDSC).</li>
      </ul>
    </TimeLineElement>

    <TimeLineElement
      title="Universidad Militar Nueva Granada, Bogotá, Colombia"
      subtitle="BSc in Mechatronics Engineering"
      date="Jan 2017 – Apr 2022"
    >
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5">
        <li>Graduated <strong>Cum Laude</strong> with <strong>highest GPA in cohort (4.54/5.0)</strong>.</li>
        <li><strong>Bachelor’s Thesis:</strong> Design and Implementation of Nonlinear Controllers for 3D Printing Systems (5.0/5.0), awarded Tesis Laureada (highest honors).</li>
        <li><strong>Honors & Awards:</strong> University Medal for Academic Merit, 5× Matrícula de Honor (highest semester GPA).</li>
        <li><strong>Scholarship:</strong> Full scholarship awarded by Colombian Ministry of ICT.</li>
        <li><strong>Extracurriculars:</strong> Member of Davinci research group; Karate team competitor (multiple medals).</li>
      </ul>
    </TimeLineElement>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Research Experience</div>
  </div>

  <div class="time-line-container mb-10">
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Research Assistant in Explainable AI - Volunteer"
      subtitle="King's College London"
      date="Sep 2023 -Present"
    >
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5">
        <li>Developed real-time explanation methods for computer vision models, advancing interpretability in AI systems.</li>
        <li>Authored peer-reviewed research and submissions to top-tier AI conferences on Explainable AI and computer vision.</li>
        <li>Built and optimized ML pipelines using PyTorch, ONNX, and cloud platforms for reproducible research workflows.</li>
      </ul>
    </TimeLineElement>

    <TimeLineElement
      title="Teaching Assistant"
      subtitle="Universidad Militar Nueva Granada"
      date="Aug 2020 -Jun 2021"
    >
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5">
        <li>Delivered tutorials and mentorship for <strong>Mechatronic Systems Models</strong> courses, supporting student learning and technical skill development.</li>
        <li>Contributed to the <strong>Davinci research group</strong>, working on nonlinear control systems and applied mechatronics research.</li>
      </ul>
    </TimeLineElement>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Industry Experience</div>
  </div>

  <div class="time-line-container mb-10">
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Software Engineer -AI"
      subtitle="Linqia, San Francisco (Remote)"
      date="Jan 2025 -Present"
    >
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5">
        <li>Built scalable <strong>multimodal AI pipelines</strong> integrating vision and language models (Vertex AI, Gemini) for large-scale video data processing and structured information extraction.</li>
        <li>Designed <strong>LLM-powered AI agents</strong> using ReAct (Reason + Act) framework with Model Context Protocol (MCP) tools for real-time retrieval and system interaction.</li>
        <li>Applied LLMs for <strong>clustering</strong> and <strong>topic modeling</strong> on high-volume text data, enabling automated insight generation at scale.</li>
        <li>Implemented <strong>semantic search</strong> with SentenceBERT embeddings and Pinecone; optimized production ML pipelines with Docker and Kubernetes.</li>
      </ul>
    </TimeLineElement>

    <TimeLineElement
      title="Software Engineer"
      subtitle="Quorum Software, Bogotá, Colombia & London, United Kingdom"
      date="Dec 2022 -Dec 2024"
    >
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5">
        <li>Designed and deployed a <strong>document classification pipeline</strong> in PyTorch with SHAP-based explainability, benchmarked against fine-tuned SentenceBERT baselines on Azure ML.</li>
        <li>Architected a <strong>Generative AI application</strong> using Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) with Azure AI Search and GPT, serving distributed teams across three countries.</li>
      </ul>
    </TimeLineElement>

    <TimeLineElement
      title="Junior Software Developer"
      subtitle="Kin + Carta, Remote (US, Argentina, Colombia collaboration)"
      date="Mar 2022 -Oct 2022"
    >
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5">
        <li>Built and deployed <strong>Java RESTful APIs</strong> on GCP, supporting scalable automation and decision-making pipelines.</li>
      </ul>
    </TimeLineElement>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Volunteering</div>
  </div>

  <div class="time-line-container mb-10">
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Web Dev Student Lead"
      subtitle="Google Developer Students Club -King’s College London"
      date="Sep 2023 -Mar 2024"
    >
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5">
        <li>Led a workshop on <strong>MLOps in Google Cloud</strong>, demonstrating how to use Vertex AI to automatically train and deploy a neural network for digit recognition using the MNIST dataset.</li>
        <li>Conducted a session on applying <strong>Vertex AI APIs</strong> for industry applications, including text-to-speech, speech-to-text, and face recognition.</li>
        <li>Presented on developing <strong>APIs with Flask</strong> for NLP tasks such as lemmatization and named entity recognition using spaCy.</li>
      </ul>
    </TimeLineElement>

    <TimeLineElement
      title="Computer Skills Education Volunteer"
      subtitle="Fundación Laudes Infantis"
      date="Jul 2022 -Jun 2023"
    >
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5">
        <li>Taught <strong>basic robotics</strong> to children in low-income areas of Bogotá, empowering dozens of individuals with hands-on STEM skills.</li>
        <li>Provided foundational <strong>JavaScript and HTML education</strong> to adolescents and adults, helping them build websites to support their entrepreneurial ventures.</li>
      </ul>
    </TimeLineElement>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Certifications</div>
  </div>

  <ul class="list-disc mx-6 mb-10 grid gap-2">
    <li><a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/users/santiagocalderon/credentials/e0bea56fd07e8ab7" target="_blank" class="text-teal-600 hover:text-teal-800 underline">Microsoft Certified DP-100: <strong>Azure Data Scientist Associate</strong></a></li>
    <li><a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/users/santiagocalderon/credentials/e5960be874975467" target="_blank" class="text-teal-600 hover:text-teal-800 underline">Microsoft Certified AI-102: <strong>Azure AI Engineer Associate</strong></a></li>
    <li><a href="https://www.credential.net/4325239e-1c48-44d9-a500-56f497288778" target="_blank" class="text-teal-600 hover:text-teal-800 underline">Google Cloud Certified – <strong>Associate Cloud Engineer</strong></a></li>
  </ul>

  <div class="mt-8 text-center">
    <a
      href="/CV_Santiago_Calderon_Pena.pdf"
      download
      target="_blank"
      class="btn btn-outline ml-5"
    >
      Download CV
    </a>
  </div>

</BaseLayout>
